└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
   │
   ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Builder                                                     │
│  backend/agents/builder/{agent,workflow}.ts                 │
│  consumes: Prompt_id + Plan_id                              │
│  produces: Build Result → Hash Verification → DONE          │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```



## Support layers (precede the pipeline)

```
Chat turns
   → Intent(id) revision
   → required information check
      ├─ missing  → ROOT_CAUSE + targeted help → user answer → Intent revision
      └─ sufficient → Prompt(id) → [pipeline above]
```

Task Management, ADK graph, Intent graph, and Authority graph are
projections/support metadata — excluded from `confirmed_package.core`.

## Artifact ownership

Defined in `backend/workflow/graph.json`:

| Artifact | Owner | Consumers |
|---|---|---|
| Researcher(id), plan_id, schema_id, fixture_id, goal_id, validation_id | Researcher | downstream agents + validators |
| audit_id | Planner | Refactor |
| gap_0 | GapAnalysis | Evaluation |
| evaluation | Evaluation | SchemaValidation, FixtureValidation, GoalValidation |

## Result vocabulary

- Workflow operations: `PASSED | ROOT_CAUSE`
- Validation operations: `VALID | NOT_VALID`

## External verification boundary

The confirmed immutable package and its hash may be handed to the external
Builder/Sandbox boundary. Verification uses the same canonical comparable
representation and direct equality: `HASH == hash_sandbox`.

Execution/checkpoint metadata remains outside `confirmed_package.core`.

